@startuml Legend

!startsub LEGEND
legend right
    **Index Notation:**
    |= Index |= Range |= Meaning |
    | μ, ν, λ, σ | 1 to n_basis | Basis function (AO) indices |
    | p | 1 to K | Primitive Gaussian index within contraction |
    | i, j | 1 to n_occ | Occupied molecular orbital indices |
    | a, b | n_occ+1 to n_basis | Virtual molecular orbital indices |
    | A, B | 1 to N_atoms | Atom center indices |
    ----
    **Symbol Legend:**
    |= Symbol |= Description |
    | **S** | Overlap matrix - measures basis function overlap |
    | **T** | Kinetic energy matrix - electron kinetic energy |
    | **V** | Nuclear attraction matrix - electron-nucleus interaction |
    | **H** | Core Hamiltonian - one-electron energy operator |
    | **F** | Fock matrix - effective one-electron operator |
    | **P** | Density matrix - electron probability distribution |
    | **C** | MO coefficient matrix - orbital expansion coefficients |
    | **X** | Orthogonalization matrix - transforms to orthogonal basis |
    | **ε** | Orbital energies - eigenvalues of Fock matrix |
    | ERI | Electron repulsion integrals - two-electron interactions |
    | E_nuc | Nuclear repulsion energy - nucleus-nucleus interaction |
    | E_elec | Electronic energy - total electron energy |
    | E_total | Total energy - sum of electronic and nuclear energies |
    | N_occ | Number of occupied orbitals (RHF) |
    | N_α, N_β | Number of alpha/beta electrons (UHF) |
    | N_closed, N_open | Closed/open shell electron counts (ROHF) |
    | ⟨Ŝ²⟩ | Spin expectation value - spin purity measure |
    | DIIS | Direct Inversion of Iterative Subspace - convergence accelerator |
    ----
    **Method Comparison:**
    |= Component |= RHF |= UHF |= ROHF |
    | Fock input | **F** | **F**^α, **F**^β | **F**_eff |
    | Density | **P** | **P**^α, **P**^β, **P**^T | **P**_closed, **P**_open |
    | DIIS stores | **F**, **e** | **F**^α/β, **e**^α/β | **F**_eff, **e** |
    | # Diagonalizations | 1 | 2 (α and β) | 1 |
    | MO extraction | first N_occ cols | first N_α/β cols | partition by shell |
    |<#LightGreen> Color |= RHF |<#LightCoral> UHF |<#LightYellow> ROHF |
endlegend
